If you are forgetting your spells and/or running low on food, then ditch 
the amulet and level teleport back to your cache. There are no rules which 
say you have to carry the amulet all the way back from the lowest level to 
level 1.

Better still, chuck the amulet to Asmodeus, nip up to your cache to 
restock, then come back down and spend a bit of time chasing Asmodeus up 
the stairs. That way you don't experience the bad effects of carrying the 
amulet (just remember that sometimes the force will knock Asmodeus down a 
level instead of up).

